{"version":1,"content":"<p>OpenAI宣佈推出全新的支付功能ChatGPT Wallet，允許AI代理在獲得授權後代表用户完成在線購物和付款流程。為實現這一功能，OpenAI與美國運通（American Express）、萬事達卡（Mastercard）和Visa等主流支付網絡展開合作，希望進一步推動AI代理從信息助手向實際執行任務工具轉變。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586304.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T17:25:15.722753+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T17:03:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T17:18:22.709628+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T17:18:22.709628+00:00","content_hash":"dd9ce8a04e5063e7ed7c7a011aba67942539b9ca5fa0269c845f9e7d13d37b46","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}